# Testing

## Framework

- xUnit (`[Fact]`, `[Theory]` + `[InlineData]`).
- Test projects mirror source: `POE2Radar.Core.Tests`, `POE2Radar.Overlay.Tests`.

## What to test (required)

- **Pure logic**: pathfinding, projection math, hotkey encoding, migration transforms, display policy, parsers (`SvgPath`, `HotkeyCodes`).
- **Settings migrations**: every new `Migrate()` branch gets a test in `RadarSettingsMigrationTests`.
- **Regression bugs**: add a test when fixing logic that can break silently.

## What not to unit test

- Live memory reads (use Research probes in-game).
- Full ImGui/DirectX render pipeline.
- Windows API integration beyond thin wrappers with test doubles.

## Style

- `public sealed class XxxTests` naming.
- Arrange / Act / Assert; one behavior per test method.
- Prefer deterministic inputs — no `DateTime.Now` without injection.
- No test-only code in production unless behind `#if` (avoid).

## Running

`dotnet test` from repo root before merging logic changes.
